# The automated tests on this PC (docs/environments.md): the test scripts and the APIs they start. Committed: no secrets.
# Every test run makes a database of its own on this PC's Postgres 17 (typeplay_autotest_<script>_<id>,
# scripts/test-run.mjs) and sets DATABASE_URL and DIRECT_URL to it; the values here only keep this mode on this PC's
# Postgres (never the live database in .env) for a process started in it by hand.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres@127.0.0.1:54329/typeplay_autotest
DIRECT_URL=postgres://postgres@127.0.0.1:54329/typeplay_autotest
